- Deadlock prevention via sorted alphabetical file acquisition in single atomic operation
- Proper error handling and resource cleanup
- Well-documented with clear inline comments
- Follows all bash standards (`set -euo pipefail`, ERR trap, VERSION, module guard)
- No obvious logic errors, security vulnerabilities, or TODOs in the code itself

